{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1788179321000-f460c4", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "生成一段给超期客户的催款函话术，语气要克制专业。", "id": "d2a4551a0fbd498fab37d59f7adf9375", "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:28:41", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "d6a832b63c444b26a26533ec83ad132b", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:28:41", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "5b2d13a67b494e7985fdeef075120fdb", "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:28:49", "finished_at": "2026-08-31T12:29:21"}, {"type": "text", "text": "**催款函（节选）**\n尊敬的客户：\n感谢贵司长期信任。经财务核对，贵司合同 X 号项下货款 ¥XX 万元已超约定账期 X 天。为保障双方合作顺畅，烦请于本月 X 日前安排付款；如已付款请忽略本函并告知流水号，我们即时核销。\n如有疑问，欢迎随时联系业务员或我本人。\n——金汉隆财务部", "id": "6dea472cd6974db1a35f1fc91d70ba68", "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:28:49", "finished_at": "2026-08-31T12:29:21"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "7612101f93c240c9a3b615778c3f9aa5", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:28:49", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-08-31T12:29:21", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "大客户能不能单独放宽到 60 天？", "id": "45932158487a477db3cb2f707179f285", "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:31:41", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "fb44eaa1f3214212a0f927ea0544cc51", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:31:41", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "3ead12bfc755490fa4b00cc3f3265fe4", "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:31:49", "finished_at": "2026-08-31T12:32:21"}, {"type": "text", "text": "可以，但建议走授信流程：由销售提报 → 财务评估其历史回款记录 → 我审批，单户授信上限建议不超过其半年平均采购额。放宽账期要与订单量挂钩，避免只挂账不增量。", "id": "ea122ccca82949ddad8eddfad4bb22b8", "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:31:49", "finished_at": "2026-08-31T12:32:21"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "ba7500a3778744ebb077c62336cab244", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:31:49", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-08-31T12:32:21", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "授信额度批准后多久复核一次？", "id": "1eb20a06449642a5ae4136ed6a3cad0d", "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:33:21", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "5507cb4a3cae412e95ba0cb009d705d2", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:33:21", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "43fdd580db864040aad2ba9cd7b6751b", "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:33:27", "finished_at": "2026-08-31T12:34:06"}, {"type": "text", "text": "每季度复核一次：回款正常的维持，出现逾期的下调或转现款；年度末统一重估。授信不是终身制，账期是资源，要给守约的客户。", "id": "f445139f1a8a4a78a8828f696042d18c", "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:33:27", "finished_at": "2026-08-31T12:34:06"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "db32f770efe04a16ac56609fe3ff72ff", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-08-31T12:33:27", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-08-31T12:34:06", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}